生日蛋糕3#Third-Anniversary Interactive Birthday Cake:|
为了报答主人去年生日制作的惊喜蛋糕，今年萝莉丝打算扳回一局，制作了带考验的生日蛋糕，每个蛋糕都有一个关于桌宠生日的问题，只有回答正确才能好好享用生日蛋糕，回答错误虽然也可以享用惊喜蛋糕但是会被调皮萝莉丝恶作剧，真是记仇呢。#Last year, Master made Lolis a surprise birthday cake. This year, she's out to return the favor—and settle the score—with a batch of cakes that each come with a challenge. Every cake asks a question about VPet's birthday. Get it right, and you can enjoy your cake in peace. Get it wrong, and you still get the surprise cake... plus one of mischievous Lolis's pranks. She sure knows how to hold a grudge!:|
