三周年生日蛋糕#Third-Anniversary Birthday Cake:|
拍摄于桌宠制作蛋糕的厨房,桌宠正和主人炫耀自己亲手做的生日蛋糕，殊不知一场考验正等着主人。#Taken in the kitchen where VPet makes cakes. VPet proudly shows Master the birthday cake she made from scratch—but little does Master know, a challenge awaits.:|
